---@field role? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.ClientRoleEnum|string Required. The role assigned to the client. Each role implies a set of permissions granted to the client.
---@field state? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.ClientStateEnum|string Output only. The state of the client.
