---Real-time bidding metrics. For what each metric means refer to [Report metrics](https://support.google.com/adxbuyer/answer/6115195#report-metrics)
---@class gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.RtbMetrics
---@field filteredBidRate7Days? number Filtered bid rate in last 7 days, calculated by (filtered bids / bids).
---@field bidRequests7Days? string Bid requests in last 7 days.
---@field bidRate7Days? number Bid rate in last 7 days, calculated by (bids / bid requests).
---@field mustBidRateCurrentMonth? number Must bid rate for current month.
---@field adImpressions7Days? string Ad impressions in last 7 days.
---@field bids7Days? string Bids in last 7 days.

---@class gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.SendRfpBuyersProposalsRequest
---@field buyerContacts? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.ContactList Contact information for the buyer.
---@field publisherProfile? string Required. The profile of the publisher who will receive this RFP in the format: `buyers/{accountId}/publisherProfiles/{publisherProfileId}`.
---@field client? string If the current buyer is sending the RFP on behalf of its client, use this field to specify the name of the client in the format: `buyers/{accountId}/clients/{clientAccountid}`.
---@field preferredDealTerms? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.PreferredDealTerms The terms for preferred deals.
---@field geoTargeting? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.CriteriaTargeting Geo criteria IDs to be targeted. Refer to Geo tables.
---@field inventorySizeTargeting? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.InventorySizeTargeting Inventory sizes to be targeted. Only PIXEL inventory size type is supported.
---@field flightEndTime? string Required. Proposed flight end time of the RFP. A timestamp in RFC3339 UTC "Zulu" format. Note that the specified value will be truncated to a granularity of one second.
---@field estimatedGrossSpend? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.Money Specified by buyers in request for proposal (RFP) to notify publisher the total estimated spend for the proposal. Publishers will receive this information and send back proposed deals accordingly.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the proposal being created by this RFP.
---@field flightStartTime? string Required. Proposed flight start time of the RFP. A timestamp in RFC3339 UTC "Zulu" format. Note that the specified value will be truncated to a granularity of one second.
---@field note? string A message that is sent to the publisher. Maximum length is 1024 characters.
---@field programmaticGuaranteedTerms? gcp.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1.ProgrammaticGuaranteedTerms The terms for programmatic guaranteed deals.
---@field buyer string Required. The current buyer who is sending the RFP in the format: `buyers/{accountId}`.

